      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Let \\(\\angle B=x,\\) so \\(\\angle A=4x.\\) The complement condition gives \\[ 90-x=4(90-4x). \\] Hence \\(15x=270\\) and \\(x=18^\\circ.\\) Thus the correct answer is D.",
